    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After investigating a missing person's report, you find yourself trapped deep below the earth. As you soon find out, you are not alone...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentlessly hunted by a cursed demon, you must explore and escape a complex soviet-era bunker network. Craft tools to help you stay alive, make smart use of your limited resources, and DON'T GET CAUGHT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/5021f5ce2e57b721296ebabadac2b0a4.avif?t=1743005411\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through a soviet-era network of bunkers, tunnels, and sewers. Discover occult rituals, strange notes, and uncover what has happened here. Are there others trapped with you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/590833370cbb75c212f864f693c5597b.poster.avif?t=1743005411\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/590833370cbb75c212f864f693c5597b.webm?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/590833370cbb75c212f864f693c5597b.mp4?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scarce resources wisely, collect materials, and craft tools to help you stay alive. Overcome challenges in multiple ways and discover new tools that allow you to rediscover previously inaccessible parts of the bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/0c5c6f753ecc58c9bbf90c8d04f13ea8.poster.avif?t=1743005411\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/0c5c6f753ecc58c9bbf90c8d04f13ea8.webm?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/0c5c6f753ecc58c9bbf90c8d04f13ea8.mp4?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the deadly bunker network, you must avoid attracting the attention of satanic entities. Be quiet, stay hidden in the shadows, and when no other option remains, fight head-on or run for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/ef3797658ead32f2eff0fd66db9451ec.poster.avif?t=1743005411\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/ef3797658ead32f2eff0fd66db9451ec.webm?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/ef3797658ead32f2eff0fd66db9451ec.mp4?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avoid an intelligent monster that responds to your actions and is relentlessly hunting you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore and escape a complex network of bunkers, tunnels, and sewers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft makeshift tools and manage your scarce resources to stay alive </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in high-fidelity interactions with the world and beings living in it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncover the origins of the demonic entity and the source of their power </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedural generation makes sure no two playthroughs are the same</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After investigating a missing person's report, you find yourself trapped deep below the earth. As you soon find out, you are not alone...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentlessly hunted by a cursed demon, you must explore and escape a complex soviet-era bunker network. Craft tools to help you stay alive, make smart use of your limited resources, and DON'T GET CAUGHT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/5021f5ce2e57b721296ebabadac2b0a4.avif?t=1743005411\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through a soviet-era network of bunkers, tunnels, and sewers. Discover occult rituals, strange notes, and uncover what has happened here. Are there others trapped with you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/590833370cbb75c212f864f693c5597b.poster.avif?t=1743005411\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/590833370cbb75c212f864f693c5597b.webm?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/590833370cbb75c212f864f693c5597b.mp4?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scarce resources wisely, collect materials, and craft tools to help you stay alive. Overcome challenges in multiple ways and discover new tools that allow you to rediscover previously inaccessible parts of the bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/0c5c6f753ecc58c9bbf90c8d04f13ea8.poster.avif?t=1743005411\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/0c5c6f753ecc58c9bbf90c8d04f13ea8.webm?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/0c5c6f753ecc58c9bbf90c8d04f13ea8.mp4?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the deadly bunker network, you must avoid attracting the attention of satanic entities. Be quiet, stay hidden in the shadows, and when no other option remains, fight head-on or run for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/ef3797658ead32f2eff0fd66db9451ec.poster.avif?t=1743005411\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/ef3797658ead32f2eff0fd66db9451ec.webm?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091120/extras/ef3797658ead32f2eff0fd66db9451ec.mp4?t=1743005411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avoid an intelligent monster that responds to your actions and is relentlessly hunting you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore and escape a complex network of bunkers, tunnels, and sewers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft makeshift tools and manage your scarce resources to stay alive </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in high-fidelity interactions with the world and beings living in it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncover the origins of the demonic entity and the source of their power </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedural generation makes sure no two playthroughs are the same</p></li></ul>",
